/*
 * ver.rc - VER.DLL's version resource, written by tools/mkver.py (the
 * Makefile; OpenWatcom's 16-bit VERSIONINFO is not readable by 3.1's
 * VER.DLL, ARCHITECTURE.md 20). The numbers are 3.1's (3.10.0.103, read
 * with tools/neres.py: programs check the library's version), the texts
 * w16's (ARCHITECTURE.md 3).
 */
1 16 MOVEABLE PURE "verver.bin"
